msgid "Debugging with send_text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/debug-with-send-text.rst:7
#: 3ad4334635744bea8730e672a58bc502
msgid "A simple way to send small short debug messages (50 characters or less) to the ground station is to use `GCS_MAVLink::send_text() <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/GCS_MAVLink/GCS.h#L112>`__.  Data sent in this will will appear on the ground station's HUD and messages area."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/debug-with-send-text.rst:9
#: 7db6aaa497c84d8dbab64406b5dc7158
msgid "At the top of the file in which you wish to do the print include GCS_MAVLink.h/GCS.h"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/debug-with-send-text.rst:15
#: 6a395b5f9fdc49dea766c2df8891bdc5
msgid "Then at the point in the code where the print should occur add the send_text command"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/debug-with-send-text.rst:21
#: f62e9f65702f45779d0bd64b428cdce9
msgid "In parts of the code where loops are running very quickly it may be necessary to throttle the output"
msgstr ""

